*> The record of a file described FD ... GLOBAL can be used by the
*> programs nested in the one that declares it.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. OUTER.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT SHARED-FILE ASSIGN TO "SHARED".
    SELECT OWN-FILE ASSIGN TO "OWN".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  SHARED-FILE GLOBAL.
01  SHARED-REC          PIC X(5).
FD  OWN-FILE.
01  OWN-REC             PIC X(5).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "INNER"
    STOP RUN.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INNER.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    WRITE SHARED-REC FROM "Hello"
    MOVE "X" TO OWN-REC
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM INNER.
END PROGRAM OUTER.
